<title>USA: Trism Inc Q1 loss widens to $0.59/shr.</title>
<headline>Trism Inc Q1 loss widens to $0.59/shr.</headline>
<dateline>KENNESAW, Ga. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>						 THREE MOS	THREE MOS</p>
<p>						    ENDED	     ENDED</p>
<p>					    MAR 31, 1997   MAR 31, 1996</p>
<p> Revenues					$77,733	  $73,040</p>
<p> Operating income (loss)(1)		(1,052)		250</p>
<p> Net income (loss)(1)			(3,406)	  (2,198)</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) per common share	  (.59)	    (.38)</p>
<p>Number of shares used in computation of</p>
<p>  earnings (loss) per common share	 5,737	    5,734</p>
<p>NOTE: (1) 1997 Q1 includes a provision in the 1997 period</p>
<p>of $3.0 million ($2.1 million, or $0.37 per share, after tax)</p>
<p>for estimated restructuring costs associated with the</p>
<p>company's organizational changes.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
